#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "SoftFloat 2b (Musashi's FPU)"
msgstr "SoftFloat 2b（Musashi の FPU）"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "LZMA SDK (libchdr's LZMA decoder): public domain"
msgstr "LZMA SDK（libchdr の LZMA デコーダー）：パブリックドメイン"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "crt-guest-advanced-fast: GNU GPL v2 or later"
msgstr "crt-guest-advanced-fast：GNU GPL v2 以降"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "TinySoundFont (the launcher's music): MIT"
msgstr "TinySoundFont（ランチャーの音楽）：MIT"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Lua (mods' scripts): MIT"
msgstr "Lua（MOD のスクリプト）：MIT"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "DXVK: zlib (Linux packages)"
msgstr "DXVK：zlib（Linux 版パッケージ）"

#. %1 is a licence file's path, %2 HIRAKU's folder
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "%1 was not found in the HIRAKU folder (%2)."
msgstr "HIRAKU のフォルダー（%2）に %1 が見つかりません。"

#. one credit in About > Software: %1 the software's name, %2 its licence and holders, %3 what it does in HIRAKU
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "<b>%1</b> (%2): %3"
msgstr "<b>%1</b>（%2）：%3"

#. one reference in About > Software: %1 its name, %2 what it was used for
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "<b>%1</b>: %2"
msgstr "<b>%1</b>：%2"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Konami arcade games as native programs, on Linux and Windows. Firebeat games run their PowerPC code recompiled (or, in a package, through HIRAKU's own analysis of it); DJ Main, System 573, Twinkle and Python run on the same shell, behind this launcher."
msgstr "Konami のアーケードゲームをネイティブプログラムとして、Linux と Windows で動かします。Firebeat のゲームは PowerPC のコードを再コンパイルして（パッケージ版では HIRAKU 自身の解析を通して）実行し、DJ Main・System 573・Twinkle・Python は共通の土台の上で、このランチャーから動きます。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "HIRAKU ships no game data. It runs your own dumps."
msgstr "HIRAKU にはゲームデータは含まれていません。ご自身のダンプで動作します。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "The licence notice below is legal text, kept in English."
msgstr "以下のライセンス表記は法的な文章のため、英語のままです。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Code taken from other projects keeps its own licence and notices: see Software and Licences."
msgstr "他のプロジェクトから取り入れたコードは、それぞれのライセンスと表記を保っています。「ソフトウェア」と「ライセンス」タブをご覧ください。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "%1 are trademarks of Konami. HIRAKU is not affiliated with or endorsed by Konami."
msgstr "%1 は Konami の商標です。HIRAKU は Konami とは関係がなく、Konami の承認も受けていません。"

#. %1 the Qt version HIRAKU was built with, %2 the one it runs on
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Built with Qt %1, running on Qt %2."
msgstr "Qt %1 でビルド、Qt %2 で実行中。"

#. who holds a code's copyright, in About > Software: %1 a project's or person's name
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "%1 and contributors"
msgstr "%1 と貢献者"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the sp2xdev team and the SpiceTools contributors"
msgstr "sp2xdev チームと SpiceTools の貢献者"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Code in HIRAKU"
msgstr "HIRAKU に含まれるコード"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the devices of the XT446 synth card, System 573, Twinkle and the multi-session unit, on HIRAKU's own shim of MAME's framework. Copyright holders are named in each file."
msgstr "XT446 シンセカード、System 573、Twinkle、マルチセッションユニットの各デバイス（MAME のフレームワークを HIRAKU 独自の互換層の上で使用）。著作権者は各ファイルに記載されています。"

#. %1 a person's online name
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "%1's System 573 work"
msgstr "%1 による System 573 の成果"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the multi-session unit, its TC9446F MP3 decoders, SIO1 as a UART, the TX3927 CPU."
msgstr "マルチセッションユニット、その TC9446F MP3 デコーダー、UART としての SIO1、TX3927 CPU。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the 68000 of the Firebeat SPU and the 68EC020 of DJ Main."
msgstr "Firebeat SPU の 68000 と DJ Main の 68EC020。"

#. %1 the licence and holders of SoftFloat 3 (names: keep them)
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "release 2b in Musashi; Berkeley SoftFloat 3 (%1) in the MIPS CPUs."
msgstr "Musashi ではリリース 2b、MIPS CPU では Berkeley SoftFloat 3（%1）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the MP3 decoding of the 573's digital I/O board and the multi-session unit."
msgstr "573 のデジタル I/O ボードとマルチセッションユニットの MP3 デコード。"

#. %1 libchdr (a link), %2 its licence and holders, %3 dr_flac, %4 its holder, %5 the LZMA SDK, %6 its holder
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "<b>%1</b> (%2), with %3 (public domain or MIT-0, %4) and the %5's decoder (public domain, %6): MAME's CHDs read in place."
msgstr "<b>%1</b>（%2）、%3（パブリックドメインまたは MIT-0、%4）と %5 のデコーダー（パブリックドメイン、%6）を含む：MAME の CHD をそのまま読み込みます。"

#. %1 and %2 the shaders' authors' names (keep them)
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "crt-guest-advanced-fast (%1) and crt-royale (%2), the picture's CRT shaders."
msgstr "crt-guest-advanced-fast（%1）と crt-royale（%2）、画面の CRT シェーダー。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the analog CRT picture, the signal, the TV and the tube."
msgstr "アナログ CRT の画面：信号、テレビ、ブラウン管。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "a CRT's rolling scan on a fast display."
msgstr "高速なディスプレイでの CRT の走査の再現。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the language of mods' scripts."
msgstr "MOD のスクリプト言語。"

#. %1 and %2 are the makers of two protocols (names: keep them)
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "presentation-time (%1) and fifo-v1 (%2), for frame pacing."
msgstr "presentation-time（%1）と fifo-v1（%2）、フレームのペース調整用。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the 64-bit PC loader's start-up of AVS2 games, its two-screen Direct3D 9, its board, card reader and licence-key stand-ins and its touch screen, written after spice2x's."
msgstr "64 ビット PC ローダーによる AVS2 ゲームの起動、2 画面の Direct3D 9、基板・カードリーダー・ライセンスキーの代替、タッチスクリーン（spice2x を参考に作成）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the binary XML of pop'n music 17 and 18's e-AMUSEMENT, written from its description of the format."
msgstr "pop'n music 17・18 の e-AMUSEMENT のバイナリ XML（そのフォーマットの解説をもとに作成）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "ライブラリ"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "this launcher."
msgstr "このランチャー。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "windows, sound, controllers and their LEDs."
msgstr "ウィンドウ、サウンド、コントローラーとその LED。"

#. %1 PCSX2 Reliquary (a link), %2 PCSX2 (a link)
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "<b>%1</b> (GPL-3.0-or-later), a fork of %2: the emulator inside the Konami Python core."
msgstr "<b>%1</b>（GPL-3.0-or-later）、%2 のフォーク：Konami Python コアの中のエミュレーター。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "LGPL-2.1-or-later; GPL-2.0-or-later as built with x264"
msgstr "LGPL-2.1-or-later、x264 込みのビルドでは GPL-2.0-or-later"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Twinkle's background video and the games' video recordings, when found at build time."
msgstr "Twinkle の背景動画とゲームの録画（ビルド時に見つかった場合）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "H.264 recordings on the processor, inside the packages' FFmpeg."
msgstr "CPU による H.264 録画（パッケージ版の FFmpeg に内蔵）。"

#. %1 nv-codec-headers (a link), %2 AMD AMF (a link)
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "<b>%1</b> and <b>%2</b> headers (MIT): H.264 recordings on NVIDIA and AMD graphics cards, with their drivers."
msgstr "<b>%1</b> と <b>%2</b> のヘッダー（MIT）：NVIDIA と AMD のグラフィックカードによる H.264 録画（各ドライバーを使用）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Apache-2.0 or MIT"
msgstr "Apache-2.0 または MIT"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "H.264 recordings by Vulkan video (AMD and Intel cards), with their drivers."
msgstr "Vulkan Video による H.264 録画（AMD・Intel のカード、各ドライバーを使用）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Keyboardmania's SoundFont stand-in for the XT446, when found at build time."
msgstr "Keyboardmania の XT446 の代わりとなる SoundFont 再生（ビルド時に見つかった場合）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the launcher's icons."
msgstr "ランチャーのアイコン。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Direct3D 9 on Vulkan for the 64-bit PC games under Wine, in the Linux packages."
msgstr "Wine 上の 64 ビット PC ゲーム向けの Vulkan 上の Direct3D 9（Linux 版パッケージ）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the oracle every core is checked against, frame by frame and access by access."
msgstr "すべてのコアを照合する基準（フレーム単位、アクセス単位）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the oracle for the Python core."
msgstr "Python コアの照合基準。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the analysis of each game program before translation."
msgstr "変換前の各ゲームプログラムの解析。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the reference for the PowerPC instruction tests."
msgstr "PowerPC 命令テストの基準。"

#. %1 and %2 are people's online names (keep them); reader/ and games/iidx/ are folders
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the names and meanings of the e-AMUSEMENT options, and the real card readers' and the BIO2 board's dialogue (its reader/ and games/iidx/); its cardio (%1) and PC/SC (%2) readers (MIT) for what those readers send; for the PC pop'n games, the I/O board's and the card reader's DLL interfaces (ezusb, libacio) and the e-AMUSEMENT services they ask for."
msgstr "e-AMUSEMENT のオプションの名前と意味、実機のカードリーダーと BIO2 基板のやり取り（reader/ と games/iidx/）、リーダーの送信内容についての cardio（%1）と PC/SC（%2）のリーダー（MIT）、PC 版 pop'n のための I/O ボードとカードリーダーの DLL インターフェース（ezusb、libacio）と要求される e-AMUSEMENT サービス。"

#. %1 a person's online name (keep it)
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "the ideas behind presses judged when they happened, the board's samples for pop'n music 16-18, the PIN typed for the player and mods that replace text (popnhax has no licence: none of its code is in HIRAKU); and %1's PopnForwarder and advice on the pop'n board."
msgstr "押した瞬間で判定する仕組み、pop'n music 16～18 の基板サンプル、プレイヤーに代わる PIN 入力、テキストを置き換える MOD の考え方（popnhax にはライセンスがないため、そのコードは HIRAKU に含まれていません）。また %1 の PopnForwarder と pop'n 基板についての助言。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "its ezusb2-popn emulation, a check of the pop'n board's packets."
msgstr "ezusb2-popn エミュレーション（pop'n 基板のパケットの確認）。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "a reference for e-AMUSEMENT servers and the later games' settings."
msgstr "e-AMUSEMENT サーバーと後期のゲームの設定の参考。"

#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "event codes, unlocks and song facts."
msgstr "イベントコード、解禁、楽曲の情報。"

#. %1 the testers' names, as a list ("a, b and c")
#: launcher/aboutdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "AboutDialog"
msgid "Thanks to the testers, %1, who tried HIRAKU on their own PCs and cabinets, and to everyone who dumped, documented and preserved these machines."
msgstr "自分の PC や筐体で HIRAKU を試してくれたテスターの %1、そしてこれらのマシンをダンプし、記録し、保存してきたすべての人に感謝します。"

