#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "The turntable as the game will see it turn: spin it to check the speed and direction"
msgstr "ゲームから見たターンテーブルの回転です。回して速度と向きを確認してください"

#. %1 is the file and the system's reason
#. %1 is the file, %2 the system's reason
#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "操作設定"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Cabinet:"
msgstr "筐体："

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Separate controls for beatmania (DJ Main), beatmania IIDX and beatmania III"
msgstr "beatmania (DJ Main)・beatmania IIDX・beatmania III の操作設定を別々にする"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Each of the three keeps its own bindings, started as a copy of the shared ones. Untick to share one set again (the separate ones are kept for next time)."
msgstr "3 機種それぞれが独自の割り当てを持ちます（最初は共通の割り当てのコピー）。チェックを外すと共通の設定に戻ります（別々の設定は次回のために残ります）。"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Click a binding, then press a key or a controller button: it replaces that keyboard's or controller's binding there. Its <b>▾</b> menu (or a right-click) adds another, removes one, resets it, or sets a turntable's speed. A warning sign marks an input that presses two controls in one game. Press anything and its name lights up."
msgstr "割り当てをクリックしてから、キーまたはコントローラーのボタンを押してください。そのキーボードまたはコントローラーの割り当てが置き換わります。<b>▾</b> メニュー（または右クリック）で、割り当ての追加・削除・リセットや、ターンテーブルの速度設定ができます。警告マークは、1 つのゲームで 2 つの操作を同時に押してしまう入力を示します。何かを押すと、その名前が光ります。"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Last input: —"
msgstr "最後の入力：—"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Set up"
msgstr "セットアップ"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Bind everything in turn, a controller's layout (the default, or one you saved), copying player 1's controller to player 2"
msgstr "全項目を順番に割り当て、コントローラーの配置（既定または保存したもの）、プレイヤー 1 のコントローラーをプレイヤー 2 にコピー"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Try in a game"
msgstr "ゲームで試す"

#. %1 is a series or cabinet, "pop'n music"
#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "No %1 game is ready to play"
msgstr "プレイ可能な %1 のゲームがありません"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Save, and start a game with these controls: its test menu's I/O check shows each input as it is pressed"
msgstr "保存して、この操作設定でゲームを起動します。テストメニューの I/O チェックで、押した入力を確認できます"

#. %1 is the file and the system's reason
#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Cannot write %1"
msgstr "%1 を書き込めません"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Save the changed controls?"
msgstr "変更した操作設定を保存しますか？"

#. %1 is the cabinets' names as a list in the language's own way ("A, B and C")
#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Shared by %1: each game uses the controls its cabinet has and ignores the rest."
msgstr "%1 で共通です。各ゲームは自分の筐体にある操作だけを使い、残りは無視します。"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Show these controls"
msgstr "これらの操作を表示"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Fold these controls away"
msgstr "これらの操作を折りたたむ"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Add another binding…"
msgstr "割り当てを追加…"

#. %1 is a binding, "Pad 1: button 3"
#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
msgid "Remove %1"
msgstr "%1 を削除"

#: launcher/controlsdialog.cpp
msgctxt "ControlsDialog"
