#: launcher/nvidia.cpp
msgctxt "NvidiaNotice"
msgid "NVIDIA setting for the PC games"
msgstr "PC ゲーム用の NVIDIA 設定"

#: launcher/nvidia.cpp
msgctxt "NvidiaNotice"
msgid "The PC games need one NVIDIA setting to start in full screen."
msgstr "PC ゲームをフルスクリーンで起動するには、NVIDIA の設定を 1 つ変更する必要があります。"

#. the NVIDIA Control Panel's menus and settings as NVIDIA's own panel names them in the language (it is
#. translated by NVIDIA); the Japanese error stays as the game shows it. %1 is the game program's path,
#. %2 the setting's value now (NVIDIA's English name), %3 where it comes from ("the global profile")
#: launcher/nvidia.cpp
#, qt-format
msgctxt "NvidiaNotice"
msgid ""
"With NVIDIA's default, HIRAKU's full-screen window takes the screen to itself, and Windows refuses the game its Direct3D (\"Direct3D の初期化に失敗しました\"). In a window the game runs either way.\n"
"\n"
"To set it, once:\n"
"1. Open the NVIDIA Control Panel (right-click the desktop, or the Start menu).\n"
"2. 3D Settings > Manage 3D settings > Program Settings.\n"
"3. Add > Browse..., and choose\n"
"    %1\n"
"4. Set \"Vulkan/OpenGL present method\" to \"Prefer layered on DXGI Swapchain\".\n"
"5. Apply.\n"
"\n"
"It's now \"%2\" (%3)."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA の既定設定では、HIRAKU のフルスクリーンウィンドウが画面を占有し、Windows がゲームの Direct3D を拒否します（「Direct3D の初期化に失敗しました」）。ウィンドウ表示ではどちらでも動作します。\n"
"\n"
"設定方法（一度だけ）：\n"
"1. NVIDIA コントロールパネルを開きます（デスクトップを右クリック、またはスタートメニュー）。\n"
"2. 3D 設定 > 3D 設定の管理 > プログラム設定。\n"
"3. 追加 > 参照... で次を選びます\n"
"    %1\n"
"4.「Vulkan/OpenGL present method」を「Prefer layered on DXGI Swapchain」にします。\n"
"5. 適用。\n"
"\n"
"現在の値は「%2」です（%3）。"

